e>ASAHARA, TAKEHIKO</last-name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>FUKUDA, SHOHEI</last-name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>NAKAMURA, AKIRA</last-name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>OKADA, TATSUO</last-name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>OOHIDA, SATOSHI</last-name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>SHIMIZU, MOTOHISA</last-name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Benzoxazole compounds represented by general formula (1); process for the preparation of them; and herbicides containing the same as the active ingredient: wherein R&lt;1&gt; to R&lt;4&gt; are each hydrogen, C1-C6 alkyl, C1-C4 alkoxy, C1-C4 haloalkyl, C1-C4 haloalkoxy, halogeno, nitro, cyano, or the like; R&lt;5&gt; is C1-C4 haloalkyl, C1-C4 haloalkoxy, halogeno, nitro, cyano, or the like; R&lt;6&gt; is hydrogen, halogeno, cyano, nitro, or the like; R&lt;7&gt; is hydrogen, C1-C6 alkyl, C1-C4 haloalkyl, or the like; and X is O, S, SO, or SO2.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des composés de benzoxazole représentés par la formule générale (1) ; un procédé d'élaboration de ceux-ci ; et des herbicides contenant ceux-ci comme principe actif. Dans la formule, R&lt;1&gt; à R&lt;4&gt; représentent chacun hydrogène, alkyle en C1-C6, alcoxy en C1-C4, haloalkyle en C1-C4, haloalcoxy en C1-C4, halogéno, nitro, cyano ou analogue ; R&lt;5&gt; représente haloalkyle en C1-C4, haloalcoxy, halogéno, nitro, cyano ou analogue ; R&lt;6&gt; représente hydrogène, halogéno, cyano, nitro ou analogue ; R&lt;7&gt; représente hydrogène, alkyle en C1-C6, haloalkyle en C1-C4 ou analogue ; et X représente O, S, SO ou SO2.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>